{"id":"000VIN","title":"Kropki's Odd Lolipop","author":"brkmmo","solvedCount":50,"difficulty":1,"rating":"89 %","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"Gestern, 00:19 Uhr","rules":"Hello, everyone! This is my first puzzle, so the feedback is very welcome.\n\nRules\n\n• Normal Sudoku rules apply: Place the digits 1-9 once in every row, column and 3x3 box.\n\n• Kropki: The white dots are between consecutive digits. Cells joined by a black dot house two digits, one of which is double the other. Not all dots are given.\n\n• Odd/Even: Digits in cells marked with a circle must be odd. Digits in cells marked with a square must be even.\n\n• Between lines: Digits along a between line must be between the digits on the circled ends of the line.\n\nFor those, playing on SudokuPad: all circled ends are odd, apart from the circle in row 9. SudokuPad didn't like the overlap, sorry about that.\n\nPlay on SudokuPad\n\nPlay on f-puzzles","solutionCode":"Row 9 left to right.","tags":["Sudoku","Even/Odd (Variante)","Kropki Pairs (Variante)","Between (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/vz68wey8b6","kind":"sudokupad"},{"url":"https://shorturl.at/YujWM","kind":"short"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://f-puzzles.com/?","linkKind":"short","summary":{"format":"fpuzzles","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":false,"features":["highlightConflicts","odd","even","difference","ratio","betweenline"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00"}